<SiteLayout title="Shipping Policy | Coding Machine Store" description="Shipping for coding machines from M. H. S. City, Ruian, Zhejiang, China. Prices are in USD excluding shipping; shipping is quoted separately for your delivery address.">
  <section class="category-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Shipping Policy</span><h1>Shipping Policy.</h1><p>Every machine ships from our factory in Ruian, Zhejiang, China. Prices on this site are per unit in USD, excluding shipping — shipping is quoted separately for your delivery address.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">How shipping is quoted</span><h2>Shipping is quoted for your address, before you pay.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Add the machine to your quote list and complete the quote form with your delivery address. We reply by email or WhatsApp with the shipping cost and availability for your order. There is no minimum order — order a single unit or a full line — and ordering 10 or more units of a machine qualifies for volume pricing.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Questions about shipping</span><h2>Ask us before you order.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@codingmachinestore.com">info@codingmachinestore.com</a> or send a message through the <a class="text-link" href="/#quote">quote form</a> with your delivery address, and we will confirm the shipping cost. Every machine is covered by a <a class="text-link" href="/return-policy/">3-month warranty — see our Return Policy</a>.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:info@codingmachinestore.com">Email info@codingmachinestore.com</a><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Continue browsing products ↓</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
